Fan-created dataset. All lore is derived from "The Stormlight Archive" series
by Brandon Sanderson, published by Tor Books / Dragonsteel Entertainment.

This dataset is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or produced in collaboration
with Brandon Sanderson or Dragonsteel Entertainment, LLC.

Coppermind (coppermind.net, CC BY-SA 4.0) is used solely as a factual
reference for verification purposes. No Coppermind text is reproduced in
this dataset. All descriptions are independently authored.
